  WrittenDialogue: "I don’t know it’s just... How can I expect to go on?\nIn high school I was thin, and hot, and popular, and now look at me!\nI’d rather read the nutrition facts on a Subway napkin than any self-help book.\nKnowing the calories makes me feel better, but I know I’m not gonna count them.\nPlease God, give me a sign."
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
